    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i've ruined everything. i was always the one they could count on, the one who actually made it. but after what happened with the internship... i just can't look my parents in the eye anymore. i feel like a complete fraud and i don't think i can ever go back to being that person again.",
